  "description": "The same loop seen from its last iteration. CDEMO-ADMIN-OPT-COUNT is 4 and the bound is UNTIL WS-IDX > count, so subscript 4 IS processed - an exclusive bound would compose three lines and leave OPTN004O blank, which is precisely the off-by-one this case exists to catch. The fourth line is transcribed from app/cpy/COADM02Y.cpy:39-42 and OPTN005O immediately after it must still be spaces, so the pair pins both ends of the range in one assertion. A different administrator id travels in the communication area to keep this a distinct run rather than a repeat of case12 - COADM01C applies no user-type filter, unlike COMEN01C, so the menu it composes does not depend on who is signed on.",
